OL,3,GNEWSATinder conman who pretended to be
OL,4,Amulti-millionaire cancer patient stole
OL,5,A#68K
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fraudster who claimed to be a special
OL,8,Fforces soldier-turned multimillionaire
OL,9,Fcancer patient has been sentenced to
OL,10,Fmore than three years in prison.
OL,12,FJoseph Gibson, 35, took almost #68,000
OL,13,Ffrom his four victims, two of whom he
OL,14,Fhad met on the dating app Tinder, and
OL,15,Fconvinced one they were in a
OL,16,Frelationship.
OL,18,FGibson, from Penbryn Nant, in Ruthin,
OL,19,FDenbighshire, lied that he had been
OL,20,Fworth hundreds of millions of pounds,
OL,21,Fhad served in the Special Boat Service,
OL,22,Fand owned yachts.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
