OL,3,GNEWSATinder conman who pretended to be
OL,4,Amulti-millionaire cancer patient stole
OL,5,A#68K
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was sentenced to three years and two
OL,8,Fmonths at Bristol Crown Court on
OL,9,FThursday, after pleading guilty to four
OL,10,Fcharges of fraud by false
OL,11,Frepresentation.
